  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Krev attempts to predict where Natsuki is dodging, slashing at her with his sword.
  - Krev slashes down from above.
  - Krev stabs at Natsuki from the side.
  - Krev swings from the side, then stabbing from above.
  - Krev sheathes his sword, drawing a bow firing arrows at Natsuki.
  - Krev fires multiple arrows at once.
  - Krev fires a stream of arrows while strafing Natsuki.
