  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Krev attempts to predict where Natsuki is dodging. Again.
  - Krev swings from the side, then stabs from above. Again.
  - Krev stabs at Natsuki from the side. Again.
  - Krev slashes down from above. Again.
  - Krev alternates between slashing at Natsuki's head and legs.
  - Krev fires yet another stream of arrows while strafing. Again.
